					<dc:identifier>http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/852/article/2/made</dc:identifier><dc:title>The Health and Social Care Act 2012 (Commencement No. 12) Order 2026</dc:title><dc:language>en</dc:language><dc:publisher>King's Printer of Acts of Parliament</dc:publisher><dc:modified>2026-07-21</dc:modified><dc:subject scheme="SIheading">HEALTH CARE AND ASSOCIATED PROFESSIONS</dc:subject>
					<dc:description>This Order brings into force section 208 of the Health and Social Care Act 2012 (c. 7) (“the Act”) in so far as it is not already in force. It is the twelfth such Order to be made under the Act.</dc:description>
