<P1para>
<Text>The day appointed for the coming into force<FootnoteRef Ref="f00002"/> of section 208 of the Health and Social Care Act 2012, in so far as it is not already in force, is the 1st October 2026.</Text>
</P1para>
</P1></P1group></Body></Secondary><Footnotes><Footnote id="f00002">
<FootnoteText>
<Para>
